---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import { path } from '../lib/paths';
import '../styles/pages.css';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>About Jom</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I’m {profile.academicName}. Most people call me Jom.</p>
      <p>
        I build AI automations in Zapier and n8n. They take over the repeat work in a business: reading
        inquiries, sorting them, and passing the right ones to a person.
      </p>
      <p>
        From 2022 to 2026 I was Head of Technology & Research at Future AI Lab / BrandNat. I designed and
        built AI workflows, multi-agent systems, and automation pipelines for content production and audience
        intelligence, connecting applied AI research with real media work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Want to see what that looks like?{' '}
        <a class="textlink" href={path('work/')}>
          Check out my previous AI automation work →
        </a>
      </p>
      <p>I'm based in Iligan City, Philippines.</p>
      <p class="also">Also: Assistant Professor at MSU-IIT · Head of PCETT · AI READY ASEAN Master Trainer</p>
    </div>
    <p class="links">
      <a class="textlink" href={path('work/')}>
        My AI automation work
      </a>
      <a class="textlink" href={path('academic/')}>
        Academic work
      </a>
      <a class="textlink" href={path('cv/')}>
        CV
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
